            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="sql-hub-card">
            <p class="sql-sheet-kicker">Worksheet 5 | HL Synthesis</p>
            <h2>Build the House Competition Database</h2>
            <p>
                Optional extension. Start from a blank workspace, build the schema from the ERD, batch-load
                a small starter dataset, and then answer aggregate-report questions.
            </p>
            <div class="sql-chip-row">
                <span class="sql-chip">Schema + ERD</span>
